 "notes": "Lamp robot (hy3d, 50k tris). Body column x 0.24-0.76 up to y 0.46; shade+bulb above (the tilted shade's rim dips to y 0.40 at the back, so the body box carves the column out of a head box that starts at 0.39). Arms hang from shoulders at x 0.25/0.75 (y 0.44) via elbows (y 0.29) to hands (y 0.10). Short legs under x 0.35/0.65 below the body disc at y 0.13. Derived from vertex slices, 2026-10-02. 2026-10-02: cap=true on head so the interior stays hidden when it moves. 2026-10-03: shoulder pivots moved 1.8 cm into the body and cap=true on both arms (device feedback: shoulder gap on the wave); presets.wave tuned so the hand waves beside the shade. cap=ball on arms and head: socket spheres at the pivots for rigid-part playback. 2026-10-03: presets.wave.abduct is now the FINAL angle from hanging (motion.py subtracts the rest angle, 14 deg here), so 78 -> 92 keeps the same pose; rigs made before keep 78 in their sidecar and wave 14 deg lower.",
